, "untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped" ],  ["untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped" ],  ["untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped", "untyped" ] ],"untyped_cells": [ {"cell_id":0,"text":"Anchoring reviews"},  {"cell_id":1,"text":"Evidence included and further analyses undertaken in this overview"},  {"cell_id":2,"text":"Review ID and care stage"},  {"cell_id":3,"text":"RCTs included (participant included)"},  {"cell_id":4,"text":"Patient population (age group)"},  {"cell_id":5,"text":"Intervention/comparator"},  {"cell_id":6,"text":"Outcomes evaluated"},  {"cell_id":7,"text":"Updating of original meta-analyses and additional analyses performed"},  {"cell_id":8,"text":"de Jonge 2019 Intraoperative and postoperative"},  {"cell_id":9,"text":"21 RCTs (17 RCTs meta-analysed, n =7817)"},  {"cell_id":10,"text":"Patients undergoing surgical procedures (adults)"},  {"cell_id":11,"text":"High F io 2 (80%)/low F io 2 (30–35%)"},  {"cell_id":12,"text":"Surgical site infection"},  {"cell_id":13,"text":"New studies were added Subgroup analyses: type of surgery, intubation vs not, use of nitrous oxide in the control group, risk of bias of the RCT, urgency of surgery Meta-regression"},  {"cell_id":14,"text":"Lim 2021 Intraoperative and postoperative"},  {"cell_id":15,"text":"26 RCTs ( n =4991)"},  {"cell_id":16,"text":"Patients undergoing non-thoracic surgery (adults)"},  {"cell_id":17,"text":"High F io 2 (80–100%)/low F io 2 (30–40%)"},  {"cell_id":18,"text":"Primary outcome: mortality within 30 days Secondary outcomes: PPCs, pneumonia, respiratory failure, atelectasis, ICU admissions, and hospital LOS"},  {"cell_id":19,"text":"New studies were added"},  {"cell_id":20,"text":"Markwei 2023 Intraoperative"},  {"cell_id":21,"text":"15 RCTs (10 RCTs meta-analysed, n =6773)"},  {"cell_id":22,"text":"Patients undergoing surgery (adults)"},  {"cell_id":23,"text":"80% vs 30% F io 2"},  {"cell_id":24,"text":"The incidence of postoperative nausea and vomiting"},  {"cell_id":25,"text":"No studies were added"},  {"cell_id":26,"text":"Hui 2022 Postoperative"},  {"cell_id":27,"text":"38 RCTs ( n =9782)"},  {"cell_id":28,"text":"Patients undergoing major elective surgery (adults)."},  {"cell_id":29,"text":"Noninvasive respiratory support (including CPAP, other forms of NIV, and HFNO)/standard postoperative care (COT)."},  {"cell_id":30,"text":"Primary outcome: pneumonia Secondary outcome: PPCs Other outcomes: mortality, ARDS, pulmonary aspiration, reintubation, unplanned ICU admissions, hospital LOS"},  {"cell_id":31,"text":"No studies were added. Results were reanalysed to focus on NIV trials. Subgroup analysis (for mortality and pneumonia): type of surgery"},  {"cell_id":32,"text":"Chaudhuri 2020 Postoperative"},  {"cell_id":33,"text":"11 RCTs ( n =2201)"},  {"cell_id":34,"text":"Patients undergoing surgical procedures (adults)"},  {"cell_id":35,"text":"HFNO/COT or NIV"},  {"cell_id":36,"text":"Mortality, reintubation, escalation of respiratory support, postoperative hypoxemia, treatment complications, ICU, and hospital LOS"},  {"cell_id":37,"text":"New studies were added to the review Subgroup analysis (for reintubation and escalation of respiratory support): type of surgery, risk of PPCs, BMI"} ]}
